## 5. Frontend Architecture

### 5.1 Directory Structure

```
frontend/src/
├── main.jsx                 # React entry point, renders <App />
├── App.jsx                  # Root: CartProvider + BrowserRouter + Routes
├── index.css                # Global styles, design tokens, glassmorphism
│
├── context/
│   └── CartContext.jsx       # Cart state: items, add, remove, update, clear
│
├── components/
│   ├── Navbar.jsx            # Fixed top nav: brand, links, cart badge, profile
│   ├── Footer.jsx            # Site footer: quick links, social, newsletter
│   └── ProductCard.jsx       # Product thumbnail: image, name, price, add-to-cart
│
└── pages/
    ├── Home.jsx              # Hero + Featured + Categories + Newsletter
    ├── Shop.jsx              # Product grid + filters + pagination
    ├── ProductDetails.jsx    # Single product view + trust badges
    ├── Cart.jsx              # Cart items + quantity + summary
    ├── Checkout.jsx          # 3-step: Shipping → Payment → Confirmation
    ├── Account.jsx           # Profile sidebar + dashboard + edit form
    ├── About.jsx             # Brand story + stats + values
    └── Contact.jsx           # Contact info + form
```

