        │         └── Values Grid (Sustainability, Artisanship, Innovation)
        │
        └─ "/contact" → <Contact />
                  ├── Contact Info (email, phone, address)
                  └── Contact Form (name, email, message)
      </Routes>

      <Footer />                         # Brand, links, social, newsletter
    </BrowserRouter>
  </CartProvider>
</App>
```

### 5.3 Data Fetching Patterns

All pages use the **fetch-on-render** pattern with `useEffect`:

```javascript
// Pattern used across all pages
const [data, setData] = useState(null);
const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);

useEffect(() => {
  fetch('/api/endpoint')
    .then(res => res.json())
    .then(result => {
      setData(result.data);
      setLoading(false);
    })
    .catch(err => {
      console.error(err);
      setLoading(false);
    });
}, [dependency]);
```

### 5.4 Route Definitions (App.jsx:22-31)

| Path | Component | API Calls on Mount |
|---|---|---|
| `/` | Home.jsx | `GET /api/products/featured` |
| `/shop` | Shop.jsx | `GET /api/products`, `GET /api/categories` |
| `/product/:id` | ProductDetails.jsx | `GET /api/products/:id` |
| `/cart` | Cart.jsx | None (localStorage) |
| `/checkout` | Checkout.jsx | `POST /api/orders` on submit |
| `/account` | Account.jsx | `GET /api/users/1` |
| `/about` | About.jsx | None (static content) |
| `/contact` | Contact.jsx | None (static content) |

### 5.5 Key Frontend Behaviors

| Behavior | Implementation | Location |
|---|---|---|
| Cart persistence | `localStorage` key `cara_cart`, synced via `useEffect` | CartContext.jsx:19-21 |
| Toast notifications | State-based popup, auto-dismiss after 3s | CartContext.jsx:14-17, 57-73 |
| Cart badge count | `cartCount` derived from `reduce` | CartContext.jsx:52 |
| Pagination math | `currentPage`, `itemsPerPage=8`, `offset = (page-1) * 8` | Shop.jsx:16 |
| Category filter | `selectedCategory` state, resets page to 1 | Shop.jsx:53-56 |
| Checkout steps | `step` state (1, 2, 3), conditional rendering | Checkout.jsx:9 |
| Loading states | Conditional rendering per page | All pages |
| Empty states | "Your cart is empty" with CTA | Cart.jsx:9-18 |

