## 7. Database Schema & Models

### 7.1 Entity-Relationship Diagram

```
┌──────────────────┐       ┌──────────────────┐
│    categories     │       │      users        │
├──────────────────┤       ├──────────────────┤
│ PK id            │       │ PK id            │
│ name (UNIQUE)     │       │ username (UNIQUE) │
│ description      │       │ email (UNIQUE)    │
│ created_at       │       │ password_hash     │
└────────┬─────────┘       │ location         │
         │                 │ role             │
         │                 │ created_at       │
         │                 └────────┬─────────┘
         │                          │
         │  ┌──────────────────┐    │
         │  │     products     │    │
         │  ├──────────────────┤    │
         └──│ FK category_id   │    │
            │ id               │    │
            │ name             │    │
            │ description      │    │
            │ price            │    │
            │ stock_quantity   │    │
            │ image_url        │    │
            │ is_featured      │    │
            │ created_at       │    │
            └────────┬─────────┘    │
                     │              │
                     │  ┌──────────────────┐    ┌──────────────────┐
                     │  │      orders      │    │   order_items    │
                     │  ├──────────────────┤    ├──────────────────┤
                     └──│ FK user_id       │    │ PK id            │
                        │ id               │◄───│ FK order_id     │
                        │ total_price      │    │ FK product_id    │
                        │ status           │    │ quantity         │
                        │ shipping_address │    │ price_at_purchase│
                        │ created_at       │    └──────────────────┘
                        └──────────────────┘
```

### 7.2 Table Definitions

#### `categories`

| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | INTEGER | PK, AUTOINCREMENT | Unique category identifier |
| name | TEXT | NOT NULL, UNIQUE | Category display name |
| description | TEXT | — | Category description |
| created_at | DATETIME | DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP | Record creation timestamp |

**Seed Data:**
- Men — "Premium apparel for men"
- Women — "Elegant fashion for women"
- Accessories — "Stylized additions to your outfit"

#### `products`

| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | INTEGER | PK, AUTOINCREMENT | Unique product identifier |
| category_id | INTEGER | FK → categories(id) | Product category |
| name | TEXT | NOT NULL | Product name |
| description | TEXT | — | Product description |
| price | DECIMAL(10,2) | NOT NULL | Product price |
| stock_quantity | INTEGER | DEFAULT 0 | Available inventory |
| image_url | TEXT | — | Unsplash image URL |
| is_featured | BOOLEAN | DEFAULT FALSE | Featured product flag |
| created_at | DATETIME | DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP | Record creation timestamp |

**Seed Data (8 products):**

| ID | Category | Name | Price | Featured |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Men | Midnight Silk Shirt | $89.99 | Yes |
| 2 | Women | Ethereal Summer Dress | $120.00 | Yes |
| 3 | Accessories | Titanium Chrono Watch | $250.00 | Yes |
| 4 | Men | Urban Leather Jacket | $299.99 | Yes |
| 5 | Women | Velvet Night Gown | $180.00 | No |
| 6 | Men | Oxford Classic Shoes | $150.00 | No |
| 7 | Accessories | Aviator Gold Shades | $199.00 | Yes |
| 8 | Women | Silk Scarf Collection | $45.00 | No |

#### `users`

| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | INTEGER | PK, AUTOINCREMENT | Unique user identifier |
| username | TEXT | NOT NULL, UNIQUE | Username for login |
| email | TEXT | NOT NULL, UNIQUE | Email address |
| password_hash | TEXT | NOT NULL | Hashed password |
| location | TEXT | — | User's city/country |
| role | TEXT | DEFAULT 'customer' | customer or admin |
| created_at | DATETIME | DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP | Registration date |

**Seed Data:**
- `ali_cara` / `ali@example.com` / `hashed_password_123` / London, UK / customer

#### `orders`

| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | INTEGER | PK, AUTOINCREMENT | Unique order identifier |
| user_id | INTEGER | FK → users(id) | Ordering customer |
| total_price | DECIMAL(10,2) | NOT NULL | Order total |
| status | TEXT | DEFAULT 'pending' | pending/shipped/delivered/cancelled |
| shipping_address | TEXT | — | Delivery address |
| created_at | DATETIME | DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP | Order placement date |

#### `order_items`

| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | INTEGER | PK, AUTOINCREMENT | Unique item identifier |
| order_id | INTEGER | FK → orders(id) | Parent order |
| product_id | INTEGER | FK → products(id) | Ordered product |
| quantity | INTEGER | NOT NULL | Quantity ordered |
| price_at_purchase | DECIMAL(10,2) | NOT NULL | Price at time of order |

