## 8. API Reference

### 8.1 Endpoint Summary

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Query Params | Auth |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/products` | List all products | `limit` (default 8), `offset` (default 0) | No |
| GET | `/api/products/total` | Get product count | `category_id` (optional) | No |
| GET | `/api/products/featured` | Featured products | None | No |
| GET | `/api/products/:id` | Single product | Path param: `id` | No |
| GET | `/api/categories` | All categories | None | No |
| GET | `/api/products/category/:id` | Products by category | `limit`, `offset` | No |
| GET | `/api/users/:id` | User profile | Path param: `id` | No |
| POST | `/api/orders` | Create order | Body: `user_id`, `total_price`, `shipping_address`, `items` | No |

### 8.2 Detailed Endpoint Specifications

#### `GET /api/products`

**Description:** Retrieves paginated list of all products.

**Query Parameters:**
| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `limit` | integer | 8 | Number of products per page |
| `offset` | integer | 0 | Number of products to skip |

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "message": "success",
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "category_id": 1,
      "name": "Midnight Silk Shirt",
      "description": "A luxurious black silk shirt for evening wear.",
      "price": 89.99,
      "stock_quantity": 50,
      "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/...",
      "is_featured": 1,
      "created_at": "2026-01-01 00:00:00"
    }
  ]
}
```

**Error (400):** `{ "error": "<error message>" }`

---

#### `GET /api/products/total`

**Description:** Returns total count of products, optionally filtered by category.

**Query Parameters:**
| Parameter | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `category_id` | integer (optional) | Filter by category |

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "message": "success",
  "total": 8
}
```

---

#### `GET /api/products/featured`

**Description:** Returns all products marked as featured (`is_featured = 1`).

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "message": "success",
  "data": [
    { "id": 1, "name": "Midnight Silk Shirt", ... },
    { "id": 2, "name": "Ethereal Summer Dress", ... },
    { "id": 3, "name": "Titanium Chrono Watch", ... },
    { "id": 4, "name": "Urban Leather Jacket", ... },
    { "id": 7, "name": "Aviator Gold Shades", ... }
  ]
}
```

---

#### `GET /api/products/:id`

**Description:** Returns a single product by its ID.

**Path Parameters:**
| Parameter | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | integer | Product ID |

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "message": "success",
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "category_id": 1,
    "name": "Midnight Silk Shirt",
    "description": "A luxurious black silk shirt for evening wear.",
    "price": 89.99,
    "stock_quantity": 50,
    "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/...",
    "is_featured": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01 00:00:00"
  }
}
```

---

#### `GET /api/categories`

**Description:** Returns all product categories.

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "message": "success",
  "data": [
    { "id": 1, "name": "Men", "description": "Premium apparel for men", "created_at": "..." },
    { "id": 2, "name": "Women", "description": "Elegant fashion for women", "created_at": "..." },
    { "id": 3, "name": "Accessories", "description": "Stylized additions to your outfit", "created_at": "..." }
  ]
}
```

---

#### `GET /api/products/category/:id`

**Description:** Returns paginated products filtered by category.

**Path Parameters:**
| Parameter | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | integer | Category ID |

**Query Parameters:**
| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `limit` | integer | 8 | Products per page |
| `offset` | integer | 0 | Products to skip |

**Response (200):** Same structure as `GET /api/products`.

---

#### `GET /api/users/:id`

**Description:** Returns user profile (excludes `password_hash`).

**Path Parameters:**
| Parameter | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | integer | User ID |

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "message": "success",
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "username": "ali_cara",
    "email": "ali@example.com",
    "location": "London, UK",
    "role": "customer",
    "created_at": "2026-01-01 00:00:00"
  }
}
```

**Note:** The SQL query explicitly selects only non-sensitive fields:
```sql
SELECT id, username, email, location, role, created_at FROM users WHERE id = ?
```

---

#### `POST /api/orders`

**Description:** Creates a new order record.

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "user_id": 1,
  "total_price": 329.99,
  "shipping_address": "123 Main St, London, UK",
  "items": [
    { "id": 1, "quantity": 2, "price": 89.99 },
    { "id": 4, "quantity": 1, "price": 150.00 }
  ]
}
```

| Field | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `user_id` | integer | ID of the ordering user |
| `total_price` | number | Total order amount |
| `shipping_address` | string | Delivery address |
| `items` | array | Array of item objects (stored but not inserted into `order_items` in current implementation) |

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "message": "Order placed successfully",
  "order_id": 1
}
```

**Note:** The current implementation inserts only the order record. Order items are received but not processed into the `order_items` table. This is noted as a placeholder for future enhancement.

