- Image wrapped in `<Link to={/product/${product.id}}>` for navigation
- "Add to Cart" button calls `addToCart(product)` with `stopPropagation` to prevent link navigation
- Hover effect on image via `.product-image` class
- Card itself uses `transition: var(--transition)` with hover cursor pointer

