## 11. Design System & Theming

### 11.1 CSS Custom Properties (`index.css:1-11`)

```css
:root {
  --primary: #c9a66b;           /* Gold/Champagne — CTAs, accents */
  --secondary: #1a1a1a;          /* Charcoal — text on gold */
  --bg-dark: #0a0a0a;           /* Near-black — page background */
  --text-light: #f5f5f5;        /* Off-white — body text */
  --text-muted: #a0a0a0;        /* Grey — secondary text, labels */
  --accent: #e5c9a0;            /* Light gold — hover states */
  --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);      /* Glass surface */
  --glass-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);/* Glass border */
  --transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); /* Smooth */
}
```

### 11.2 Color Palette

```
Primary Gold    #c9a66b    ████████  Used for: buttons, prices, accents, brand
Accent Gold     #e5c9a0    ████████  Used for: hover states
Charcoal        #1a1a1a    ████████  Used for: text on gold
Near Black      #0a0a0a    ████████  Used for: page backgrounds
Off White       #f5f5f5    ████████  Used for: body text
Muted Grey      #a0a0a0    ████████  Used for: secondary text
Glass White     rgba(255,255,255,0.05)  ████████  Glass surfaces
```

### 11.3 Glassmorphism Utility (`.glass` class)

```css
.glass {
  background: var(--glass);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  border-radius: 12px;
}
```

Applied to: Navbar, product cards, category cards, order summary, checkout forms, profile cards, footer.

