## 12. Routing & Navigation

### 12.1 Route Configuration

Defined in `App.jsx:22-31` using React Router DOM v7:

```jsx
<Routes>
  <Route path="/"           element={<Home />} />
  <Route path="/shop"       element={<Shop />} />
  <Route path="/product/:id" element={<ProductDetails />} />
  <Route path="/cart"       element={<Cart />} />
  <Route path="/checkout"   element={<Checkout />} />
  <Route path="/account"    element={<Account />} />
  <Route path="/about"      element={<About />} />
  <Route path="/contact"    element={<Contact />} />
</Routes>
```

### 12.2 Navigation Links

| From | To | Component |
|---|---|---|
| Navbar brand | `/` | Link |
| Navbar "Home" | `/` | Link |
| Navbar "Shop" | `/shop` | Link |
| Navbar "About" | `/about` | Link |
| Navbar "Contact" | `/contact` | Link |
| Navbar cart icon | `/cart` | Link |
| Navbar user icon | `/account` | Link |
| Hero "Shop Collection" | `/shop` | Link |
| Hero "Our Story" | `/about` | Link |
| Category cards | `/shop` | Link |
| "View All Products" | `/shop` | Link |
| Product card image | `/product/:id` | Link |
| Product card name | `/product/:id` | Link (implicit via card Link) |
| "Go Shopping" (empty cart) | `/shop` | Link |
| "Checkout" (cart summary) | `/checkout` | Link |
| Footer "Home" | `/` | Link |
| Footer "Shop" | `/shop` | Link |
| Footer "About Us" | `/about` | Link |
| Footer "Contact" | `/contact` | Link |
| "Continue Shopping" (confirmation) | `/shop` | navigate() |
| "Back to Shop" (product details) | `/shop` | Link |

### 12.3 Navigation Guard

**Checkout page:** If cart is empty and not on confirmation step, auto-redirects to `/cart`:
```javascript
if (cartItems.length === 0 && step !== 3) {
  navigate('/cart');
  return null;
}
```

